title: TopicHub
---
<<declare $topic1 = "...">>
<<declare $topic2 = "...">>
<<declare $topic3 = "...">>

<<set $topic1 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 0)>>
<<set $topic2 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 1)>>
<<set $topic3 = GetPlayerToCharacterTopic(GetCurrentActor(), 2)>>

-> Talk about {$topic1} <<if $topic1 != "...">>
    <<detour {$topic1}>>
-> Talk about {$topic2} <<if $topic2 != "...">>
    <<detour {$topic2}>>
-> Talk about {$topic3} <<if $topic3 != "...">>
    <<detour {$topic3}>>
===